"    FfxFloat16x2 k = FfxFloat16x2(1.0 / 1.099, 0.099 / 1.099);\n"
"    return ffxZeroOneSelectHalf(ffxZeroOneIsSignedHalf(c - j.xx), c * j.yy, pow(c * k.xx + k.yy, j.zz));\n"
